<title>SINGAPORE: FHTK full year net profit up 34 pct.</title>
<headline>FHTK full year net profit up 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Sinngapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   10.71    vs    8.00</p>
<p>    Dividend (cts)	0.75    vs    nil</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)   3.67    vs    2.92</p>
<p>    Turnover	    224.62    vs  145.27</p>
<p>    Other income	  1.29    vs    0.29</p>
<p>    Operating profit   30.01    vs   19.62</p>
<p>    Interest expense    9.27    vs    6.13</p>
<p>    Depreciation	  5.58    vs    2.66</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     15.16    vs   10.83</p>
<p>    Associates	   (0.48)   vs   (0.15)</p>
<p>    Tax		     3.88    vs    2.61</p>
<p>Note - FHTK Holdings Ltd is a fruit and vegetable supplier.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
